ogle.com/drive/folders/1-Q3Nh7yhIwzohp19QqLw21e0QnHjStRe\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-Q3Nh7yhIwzohp19QqLw21e0QnHjStRe", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koutei_teki/works/11", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e98ded91/uploads/origins/71824f2b-62eb-4c5e-94bf-711e323c43db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=288108bcad5d74c2868348931b4e9478", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e98ded91/uploads/origins/71824f2b-62eb-4c5e-94bf-711e323c43db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=288108bcad5d74c2868348931b4e9478, https://si.imgix.net/e98ded91/uploads/origins/71824f2b-62eb-4c5e-94bf-711e323c43db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97394513583d0e98bfca3aadbbbddfe7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e98ded91/uploads/origins/71824f2b-62eb-4c5e-94bf-711e323c43db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f394a16f870a3f82555bca14bb79abd 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "牧野留姫\nサクヤモンの衣装でお願いします。\n胸デカめでお願いします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koutei_teki/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0fa0db28/uploads/origins/f5daaf9c-007b-43a9-accc-4a31968021ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28daf9dea840112e1347eac3820d0256", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0fa0db28/uploads/origins/f5daaf9c-007b-43a9-accc-4a31968021ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=28daf9dea840112e1347eac3820d0256, https://si.imgix.net/0fa0db28/uploads/origins/f5daaf9c-007b-43a9-accc-4a31968021ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a2de2deace9622147618ffa020a3e828 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0fa0db28/uploads/origins/f5daaf9c-007b-43a9-accc-4a31968021ef?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b1180f54ff497c59bfff141c07a82b2a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは！\n\nダークモンVSデクスドルグレイモンのイラストが欲しいです！シナリオがリアルに展開される戦闘シーンが欲しいです。(彼らのパワーレベルと結果)。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koutei_teki/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7548fec8/uploads/origins/9b46502c-e5f7-48fe-a6f4-94b490257415?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=187476fc20639d6151e69ce35f4a6cb8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7548fec8/uploads/origins/9b46502c-e5f7-48fe-a6f4-94b490257415?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=187476fc20639d6151e69ce35f4a6cb8, https://si.imgix.net/7548fec8/uploads/origins/9b46502c-e5f7-48fe-a6f4-94b490257415?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7811511aeca019f0cac17d2e6057120f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7548fec8/uploads/origins/9b46502c-e5f7-48fe-a6f4-94b490257415?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f443e41dea6ca1c5a9ce039176f586e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、あなたの絵が好きでお願いがあります。\n\nデジモンフロンティアのフェアリモンのアートが欲しいです。\n\nさりげなくたこ焼きを食べています。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@koutei_teki/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d583f1a3/uploads/origins/c4ce6a9b-6b61-4b85-a6a3-7aa8da56ee77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=edfc7eb91c8548a22f946b70c93686d8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d583f1a3/uploads/origins/c4ce6a9b-6b61-4b85-a6a3-7aa8da56ee77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=edfc7eb91c8548a22f946b70c93686d8, https://si.imgix.net/d583f1a3/uploads/origins/c4ce6a9b-6b61-4b85-a6a3-7aa8da56ee77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0994bb703d139a411e982b8748877b6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d583f1a3/uploads/origins/c4ce6a9b-6b61-4b85-a6a3-7aa8da56ee77?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=957a7e86ef4